{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1458681-if-you-had-to-make-a-z-axis-for-geist-what-would-it-be","id":1458681,"title":"If you had to make a z-axis for Geist, what would it be?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-09-04T08:27:03-07:00","id":1458681,"title":"If you had to make a z-axis for Geist, what would it be?","content":"Back in the early game lines of 1st edition, it seemed that every splat had its own (optional) z-axis: Bloodlines for Vampire, Lodges for Werewolf, Legacies for Mage, Entitlements for Changeling and Athanors for Promethean. Later game lines, however, didn't have any and 2nd edition didn't change the trend.<br /> <br /> So I was wondering what ideas could come up as a z-axis for Geist. Perhaps subsets of Krewe Archetypes, with specific creeds, traditions and mythos, related to local history or a thematic focus? They could have Krewe Esotery or Traits as prerequisites and grant exclusive Ceremonies or benefits?<br /> Or perhaps something more personal (especially for 1st edition, like more specialized subsets of Threshold)?<br /> <br /> Note that this is just a thought experiment for fun. Not discussing whether Sin-Eaters <i>should or shouldn't</i> have a z-axis.<br /> <br /> Any ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26440-moonwhisper","name":"moonwhisper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26440_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-04T14:41:16-07:00","id":1458732,"title":"","content":"Maybe some way to take Burdens from other people; not limited to the Bounds\u2019 own five archetypical ones, and a bit more personalized. Kinda like 2E Entitlements, where it\u2019s usually expected to be individual and unique. Let\u2019s call it Sin \u2014 as in, sin-eating.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-05T22:35:31-07:00","id":1458947,"title":"","content":"Honestly, it already does have a Z-splat, it's just that more could be done with it.<br /> <br /> It's Regalia, by the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-05T23:18:20-07:00","id":1458956,"title":"","content":"Yeah, there's not really much to be done for Geist in terms of making a Z-axis that <i>isn't</i> an institutional element of a krewe, because the splat is built entirely around a temporary state that doesn't even have Promethean 1e's Athanors' promise of boons in the next life. Your legacy is the thing that you built.<br /> <br /> The Abiding probably like it just fine, at least.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-11T03:19:03-07:00","id":1459638,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1458681-if-you-had-to-make-a-z-axis-for-geist-what-would-it-be?p=1458947#post1458947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly, it already does have a Z-splat, it's just that more could be done with it.<br /> <br /> It's Regalia, by the way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I can totally see Regalia framed as a Z splat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26440-moonwhisper","name":"moonwhisper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26440_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}